sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CL as Client
  participant HS as Host service
  participant PE as Process Engine
  participant RE as Rule Engine
  participant DB as Host PostgreSQL
  participant AG as AgentAdapter (model)
  participant RM as Remote system

  rect rgba(232,245,233,0.6)
    Note over HS,DB: Sync in-transaction steps (one host TX)
    CL->>HS: Start kyc-onboarding, business key APP-1042, Idempotency-Key
    HS->>PE: start(definition v1, businessKey)
    alt Same Idempotency-Key retried
      PE-->>HS: Same instance id, no second start
    else First request
      PE->>DB: Insert instance, history
      PE->>RE: decision step: evaluate(risk-rating)
      RE->>DB: Decision log insert
      PE->>DB: Token reaches agentTask, job queued
    end
    Note over HS,DB: Commit
  end

  rect rgba(255,248,225,0.7)
    Note over PE,DB: TX1 claim
    PE->>DB: Claim job with lease (SKIP LOCKED), commit
  end

  Note over PE,AG: Async wait-state: no connection held
  PE->>AG: Call with bounded inputs, timeout from the definition
  alt Timeout or adapter error
    AG-->>PE: Error
    PE->>DB: New TX: retry later, or incident when retries are spent
  else Output returned
    AG-->>PE: Structured output
  end

  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.7)
    Note over PE,DB: TX2 complete
    PE->>PE: Validate output against JSON Schema
    PE->>RE: Evaluate guardrail rule set
    alt allow
      PE->>DB: History (output, guardrail decision id), advance token
    else violation, route-to-human
      PE->>DB: Approval task for the compliance role
    end
    Note over PE,DB: Commit. A result after lease expiry is discarded
  end

  Note over PE,RM: Later service step, also outside any transaction
  PE->>RM: Remote call with attempt id
  RM-->>PE: Fails after retries
  rect rgba(243,229,245,0.6)
    Note over PE,RM: Compensation in reverse order, each attempt recorded
    PE->>RM: compensate step 2
    PE->>RM: compensate step 1
    PE->>DB: Incident visible in the cockpit
  end
